<title>CANADA: Canada Jan new motor vehicle sales fall 6.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada Jan new motor vehicle sales fall 6.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>New motor vehicle sales fell 6.3 percent seasonally adjusted in January to 105,429 units from 112,520 in December, Statistics Canada said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A Reuters survey of economists had forecast a 3.4 percent fall in January.</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau, 613-235-6745))</p>
